    "updated_at": "2025-11-08T08:07:04",
    "body": "[XLA:GPU][XTile] Remove xtile.to_tensor/scalar.\n\nThese ops were implemented as a quick stop gap to enable less test churn as they had symmetric folding but the tensor equivalent have more well defined semantics, obvious lowering patterns and will generally just make CPU lowering simpler.\n",
